sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant Source
    participant Planner
    participant Worker as CPU/GPU Worker
    participant Cache
    participant View
    participant Prov as Provenance
    UI->>Source: snapshot/read capability
    UI->>Planner: visible analysis demand
    Planner->>Cache: lookup semantic key
    alt cache miss
      Planner->>Worker: bounded job + generation
      Worker->>Source: range reads
      Worker-->>Cache: partial/refined artifact
      Worker-->>Prov: dependency record
    end
    Cache-->>View: immutable artifact handle
    View-->>UI: scene fragment + pick mappings
